WF-45 — Rebook Handler

## Inputs

### Canonical (required)
- phoneNumber: string — E.164 (without `+`). Routes all downstream lookups + sends.

### Optional (forwarded but not consumed here)
- userId: integer — passed by some callers (WF-20/WF-44); not consumed by WF-45 (the inline SELECT in Step 2 is keyed on phoneNumber).
- userStatus: string — passed by WF-44 only; not consumed.

### Caller contract note (2026-05-27, TD-PGF-08)
- WF-43 Post-Consultation Handler calls with `value: {}` (passthrough — WF-43's own upstream carries the WF-01 envelope including `user`).
- WF-44 Feedback Recorder calls with `{phoneNumber, userId, userStatus}` only — NO `user` envelope.
- WF-20 Keyword Handler (REBOOK keyword path) calls with `{phoneNumber, userId}` only — NO `user` envelope.

Because 2 of 3 callers do not carry the user envelope, WF-45 cannot rely on `$('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.user.name` — the inline SELECT in Step 2 is contract-required, not redundant. Envelope-everywhere completion for WF-45 is deferred until the 3 callers are aligned to pass the full `user` envelope (post-MVP sprint candidate; see `followups.md`).

## Summary

- Outputs: user status set back to payment_pending; WhatsApp interactive payment prompt sent (WF-50 call per design.md §2.3).
- State Transitions: consultation_closed (or other) → payment_pending.
- Calls Sub-Workflows: WF-50 (Send WhatsApp).
- Design rule: Does NOT call WF-52. Reuses the existing consult Slack channel (`slack_channel_id` stays on the users row).

---

## Algorithm

Step 1: Start — triggered by another workflow (WF-20, WF-43, or WF-44) with phoneNumber.
Step 2: SELECT id, name, phone_number FROM chinmay_astro.users WHERE phone_number = <phoneNumber> LIMIT 1. (Caller-contract required — see Inputs note; not redundant.)
Step 3: UPDATE chinmay_astro.users SET status = 'payment_pending', stage = NULL, updated_at = NOW() WHERE phone_number = <phoneNumber>.
Step 4: Build interactive WhatsApp payload:
  - body.text = "Welcome back, <user.name>! 🙏\n\nYour birth details are already on file, so we can get started right away.\n\n*Payment Information:*\nAmount: ₹500\n\nPlease send ₹500 via GPay / PhonePe / any UPI app to: +91-9653240263 (Chinmay Mujumdar). Once done, tap the button below:"
  - buttons: [ { id: "payment_completed", title: "Payment Completed" } ]
Step 5: Call WF-50 (per design.md §2.3) with phoneNumber, messageType='interactive', interactivePayload=<payload above>.
Step 6: End.
